window.products.push({"id":95143,"name":"279393 Dryer Terminal Block Screw Kit Cord Whirlpool Kenmore Screws Part - Easy to Install - Replaces Ap3020386 279393d 279393vp 3184 Ah334188 Ea33418","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F8IPVwbDS._SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 279393 Dryer Cord Screw Kit - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP3020386, 279393D, 279393VP, 3184, AH334188, EA334188, PS334188. This kit includes 3 screws and 3 nuts. 279393 Terminal Block Screw Kit is compatible with Whirlpool, Admiral, Amana, Crosley, Estate, Inglis, Kenmore, KitchenAid, Magic Chef, Maytag, Roper. It is important to check the compatibility of the kit with your dryer model to ensure that it is the correct replacement part. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the part? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Replacing the terminal block screws is a simple process that can be completed in a matter of minutes. 279393 Dryer Terminal Screws will help if your appliance does not start. A reasonable method for expanding the lifespan of your machine. 💡 The Dryer Terminal Block Screw Kit 279393 is an essential part of your dryer that connects the dryer's power cord to the internal wiring of the dryer. Whirlpool 279393 comes with three screws that secure the dryer's power cord to the terminal block. 279393 Screw Dryer Replacement meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Installing the 279393 Dryer Terminal Block Screw Kit is a straightforward process that can be done in just a few steps. Firstly, unplug your dryer from the electrical outlet. Then, locate the terminal block, which is usually located at the back of the dryer. Remove the old screws and nuts that are holding the terminal block in place. Install the new screws and nuts from the 279393 kit. Tighten the screws to ensure a secure connection. Finally, plug your dryer back in. 💡 How to replace a 279393 Dryer Cord Screw Kit? Replacing the terminal block screws with the 279393 Dryer Terminal Block Screw Kit can help ensure that your dryer is safe and functioning properly. Loose or damaged terminal block screws can cause electrical problems, which can be dangerous and even lead to fires. By using this kit to replace the screws, you can prevent these issues and extend the life of your dryer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F8IPVwbDS._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07MX3QGR1","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-95143","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MX3QGR1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MX3QGR1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
