window.products.push({"id":95181,"name":"WEBTB Manual Non-Electric Portable Clothes Washer Mini Hand Crank Washing Machine Dehydrator Hand Powered Washing Machine Manual Clothes Washer The La","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ep4KieCXL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Note:  1.The instructions in the package are in Chinese, but there are pictures of the step-by-step installation diagram. 2.If you still do not know how to install or have difficulty using it, you can contact us and we will send you an English version of the electronic manual. 3.This type of product is also easy to find online video instructions on how to use. Specification:Condition: 100% Brand NewItem Type: Washing MachineMaterial: ABSColor: GrayWeight: Approx. 2.85kg / 6.28lbsProduct Size: Approx. 40x27cm / 15.7x10.6inInstructions:1. Open the cover and turn the inner barrel a few times in a counterclockwise direction to confirm the alignment of the base. Put in the right amount of clothes and detergent.2. Add an appropriate amount of water, cover the cover, insert the handle into the hole in the center of the cover, turn the handle in the direction of the arrows on the cover, during the washing process, the pulsator at the bottom of the cleaning bucket and the body of the cleaning bucket Rotate in the opposite direction, generating water flowing impact.3. Drainage: Open the drain plug on the outside of the bottom of the barrel. 4. Rinse: First put the clothes evenly around the inner bucket, cover the cover and lock the buckles on both sides, step on the foot pedal with two feet, and then insert the handle into the outer hole on the cover, and quickly rotate the handle counterclockwise for 30 seconds, the faster the rotation, the better the dehydration effect.Package Including1 x Washing Machine1 x Handle1 x Drain pipe1 x Inlet pipe1 x Instruction ManualNote:1.Do not place the product in direct sunlight; the amount of detergent refers to the instructions for use of the detergent; after washing, please wipe all parts cleaned or dry it, so as not to cause odor inside the product for a long time. 2.Please allow 0-1 inch error due to manual measurement. Thanks for your understanding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ep4KieCXL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WEBTB","source_asin":"B0BQMN426Y","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-95181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQMN426Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQMN426Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
