window.products.push({"id":95252,"name":"Panda PAN60SWR1 13LB Compact Portable Washing Machine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61frcjfZHiL._AC_SL1071_.jpg","description":"Boasting a unique, space-saving design, new model of Panda Portable Compact 13 lbs Top Load Washer makes your laundry easy and simple. It is compact which is perfect for small loads for daily usage, you can use it in apartment, dorms, RVs, and it just the right size to be the second washer in your house. This portable top load upper drainage washing machine offers 8 different washing programs set with the touch of a button. 8 water level settings to make sure your clothes come out as clean as can be. Its sturdy and quiet design accommodates up to 13 lbs. of laundry in its stainless-steel drum which is durable and resists rust and chipping. Lightweight to carry around, regular 3 prongs 110 Voltage can be plugged anywhere. 325 Watts of motor rate, it saves the electricity bills. Brand: Panda Model: PAN60SWR1 Color of body: Light Gray Color of lid: Deep Grey Capacity: 13 lbs Wash Program: 8 Water Level: 8 Tub Material: Stainless Steel Dimensions: 20 (L) * 19. 5 (L) * 35 (H) inches, whith lid open 41 inches high Weight: 57 lbs Length of inlet hose: 39 inches Length of drain hose: 55 inches 1 Year manufacturer Please acknowledge before purchasing: *This machine only has ONE water inlet that can be connected to a standard faucet using the inlet hose and quick adapter in the package. Please adjust water temperature by the faucet. **To ensure the quality of products, 2% of the machines were water tested by the manufacturer before transporting to our warehouse, so you will have a chance to see watermark or water left outside or inside the machine. ***Please remove the black rectangular plastic piece (motor protection part) located at the bottom of the machine from the machine before using the machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61frcjfZHiL._AC_SL1071_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panda","source_asin":"B07NJ11GKQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-95252","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NJ11GKQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NJ11GKQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":95253,"name":"ZAWAGIIK Christmas Refrigerator Handle Covers Set of 6, Santa Claus Refrigerator Door Handle Protector Kitchen Appliance Handle Covers Christmas Kitch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ELQpBqd7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you tired of cleaning the fingerprints off the refrigerator handles every day? You'll never know how much you need this product until you see it! No more fingerprints from dirty fingers! No more chill from hard metal handles! Very soft touch and add a Christmas vibe to your kitchen. A wonderful Christmas present for your friends and family. PRODUCT HIGHLIGHTS: Different from other one-time use Christmas products, our detachable Velcro design for Gnome Ornaments makes this handle cover set durable and machine washable. The little ornaments don't have to be strongly washed in washing machine. And you can get off the little ornaments easily from the handle covers after Christmas, to make it possible to use it in everyday life. Handmade Christmas Refrigerator Handle Covers Material: Thick and skin-friendly short plush fabrics, double layer lining design. With enhanced Velcro, the fridge handle covers don't slide up or down. You can just adjust the Velcro fastening to the appropriate position to fit your appliance handle's width. They just stay in the right place. Gnome Refrigerator Door Handle Cover Length: 40cm/15.7in and 15cm/5.9in, both fit around 9cm-11cm/3.5in-4.3in handles, meet your different use needs. Ideal for fridge, microwave, stove, oven, dishwasher handles in shape round or flat. Package Contents: 4 x 40cm/15.7in, 2 x 15cm/5.9in, 10 x Ornaments with Velcro. Kindly Reminder: Measure the perimeter of your handle with a soft ruler before the purchase. Hold the Velcro together before throwing it in washing machine to not stick to other clothes. We have been committed to providing home solution products to customers. All products come with a 45 day and 100% satisfaction guarantee. Please contact us if you have any quality problem with the Kitchen Appliance Handle Covers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ELQpBqd7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZAWAGIIK","source_asin":"B09CVDN68Q","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-95253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CVDN68Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CVDN68Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
