window.products.push({"id":95391,"name":"Suparts W10006355 Shift Actuator Compatible with Whirlpool Washers - Replaces WPW10006355, AP6014711, 1719787, PS11747977","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.37,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ITIseo2qL._AC_SL1450_.jpg","description":"Function: The WPW10006355 Shift Actuator is for washers. This part changes the transmission from agitation to spin mode. The actuator helps shift the splutch and monitor the position of the splutch. If your top-loading high-efficiency washer has issues with long cycle times, failure to drain all the way, or the machine doesn't seem to go into high-spin, may be there is a problem. If your shifter (actuator) has a broken tooth on a gear inside the small gearmotor, it can't make the complete shift.Then you need to change it. Easy to Install To repair, ensure washer is unplugged and water is turned off. Tip the washer over to access the bottom. The shift actuator is mounted next to the motor with two screws and one wiring plug. Install the part by yourself and quickly get your washer back to work. (You can find the reference video by typing \"W10006355\" in the YouTube search bar.) Works with the following models: Whirlpool: 7MWTW1500AQ0, 7MWTW1501AW0, 7MWTW1501AW1, 7MWTW1501AW2, 7MWTW1502AW0, 7MWTW1502AW1, 7MWTW1502AW2, 7MWTW1503AW0, 7MWTW1503AW1, 7MWTW1504DQ0, 7MWTW1601BQ0, 7MWTW1602AW0, 7MWTW1602AW1, 7MWTW1602AW2, 7MWTW1602BM0, 7MWTW1603AW0, 7MWTW1603AW1, 7MWTW1603AW2, 7MWTW1604AW0, 7MWTW1604AW1, 7MWTW1604DM0, 7MWTW1605AW0, 7MWTW1605AW1, 7MWTW1606AW0, 7MWTW1606AW1, etc. Amana: NTW4501XQ0, NTW4600YQ0, NTW4600YQ1, NTW4601XQ0, NTW4610YQ0, NTW4630YQ0, NTW4650YQ0, NTW4700YQ0, NTW4700YQ1, NTW4750YQ0, NTW4750YQ1. Unsure about compatibility with your appliance model? Comment below in the customer questions and answer section or send us a message on the Suparts storefront. We’re happy to help ensure you select the right part number for your refrigerator.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ITIseo2qL._AC_SL1450_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Suparts","source_asin":"B08TC5DLSL","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-95391","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TC5DLSL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TC5DLSL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
