window.products.push({"id":95480,"name":"1043 Super Humidifier Wick Filter Replacement for AirCare Essick Bemis Evaporative Humidifier Filter 1043 ReplaceEP9 EP9R EP9R500 EP9R800 EP9500 EP970","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SjHV8OToL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【1043 WICK HUMIDIFIER FILTER】---The Upgraded 1043 Humidifier Wick Filter is made from the high-quality reinforced mesh paper with the hot glue strips and dense construction. 1043 Wick Humidifier Filter adopts advanced lower density structure technology, with higher efficiency, better quality, less pressure, it also has the most surface area for extra absorbency, better moisture output and longer use. ✅【HIGH PERFORMANCE】---An evaporative humidifier is only as good as the wick inside it. 1043 wick humidifier filter does a very good job of filtering out the hardness minerals in the water and prevents a white powder from entering the room air and depositing on everything in sight. And replacement humidifier filter can increase the humidity in the dry season and create a comfortable home environment for you. ✅【TIPS AND EASY TO INSTALL】---❶For best performance, we recommend that you fill the humidifier tank with distilled water and replace the filter every 2-3 months (depending on your specific usage). ❷The installation of 1043 humidifier filter is very simple and requires no tools, just cost you few minutes. Just take the water out of the humidifier, remove the top and the frame, remove the older or dirty filter from the humidifier, then replace with new 1043 humidifier filter, and then place the frame on the core. ✅【COMPATIBLE MODEL】---The 1043 wick humidifier filter fits for Aircare, Bemis, Essick air humidifier. ►Replaces part numbers: EP9500, EP9R500, EP9800, EP9R800, EP9700, EP9R700, 826000, 826800, 831000, SS390DWHT, 821000, 821001 and others. If you are not sure about the model, please feel free to contact us, we will answer you within 24 hours. ✅【RISK FREE SHOPPING】---During the 60 Days warranty period. If the 1043 wick humidifier filter has any quality problem or other reasons, we support return, replacement or refund. Risk-free shopping. Customer satisfaction is our unremitting pursuit. If you are not satisfied with the product, please contact us immediately, we will solve your problem within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SjHV8OToL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOMOON","source_asin":"B08QHB4NVS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-95480","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QHB4NVS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QHB4NVS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
