window.products.push({"id":95568,"name":"Beaquicy TDIDVKZW Indoor Dryer Vent Kit with 4-Inch by 5-Foot Proflex Duct, 4 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DgC8laMyS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【PRODUCT INTRODUCTION】--The TDIDVKZW Indoor dryer vent kit is designed for indoor du-st removal from electric dryers. Exhaust hoses can provide more ventilation and a sealed environment, making your dryer more efficient. The circular collector will have arched vents around it, and you can pour a small amount of water at the bottom, which will increase the efficiency of trapping the fluff. ✅【PACKAGE INCLUDED】-- TDIDVKZW Indoor dryer vent kit includes 1 x 4-inch by 5-foot proflex dryer transition duct,1 x plastic lint reservoir, 2 x plastic adjustable clamps.This TDIDVKZW Indoor Dryer Vent Kit is for venting electric dryers indoors to trap lint. Due to potentially harmful fu.mes and exhaust gas.es, this item is not recommended for use in gas dryers.Re-circulates heat back into the home.It includes mounting rings so it can be hung on a wall or wall tack near the dryer. ✅【QUALITY MATERIALS】--TDIDVKZW Indoor dryer vent kit is made of quality materials that have been fully tested by the manufacturer to improve the safety and stability of the dryer so that it can work properly in different environments. The exhaust hose has an advanced three-layer design (aluminum foil + PET + aluminum foil), and the dryer air hose connector is made of soft rubber that fits snug on your dryer hose. ✅【180 DAYS WARRANTY】--TDIDVKZW Indoor dryer vent kit supports 180 days of return and exchange. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer. No risk shopping, within the warranty period if there is any quality problem, please timely contact customer service. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our unremitting pursuit. ✅【QUICK AND EASY INSTALLATION】-- There is a simple way to install the TDIDVKZW indoor dryer vent kit. ① Fill the bottom half of the tank with water, and then close the lid. Slide one end of the air vent of the indoor dryer to the top collar of the gas storage tank and fix it with an adjustable clip. ③ Put the other end of the catheter through the outlet of the dryer and fix it with an adjustable clip. ④ Pour out the water and replace it after each use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DgC8laMyS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B08KZG8GL2","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-95568","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KZG8GL2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KZG8GL2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
