window.products.push({"id":95580,"name":"Ice Maker Machine for Countertop - Portable Ice Cube Maker delivers 24 Ice Cubes in 15 Min, 33Lbs/24H, Self-Cleaning, Ice Scoop & Basket, LCD Display,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qbZbSQFHL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Fast Ice Making] TRUSTECH countertop ice maker machine can produce 24 ice cubes per cycle (every 15 to 18 minutes). That means you can make up to 33 pounds of ice cubes every 24 hours. Best of all, you can adjust the thickness of the ice cubes according to your needs. It can better satisfy your whole family’s needs for ice cubes! [Quiet & Automatic Cleaning] The countertop ice machine is equipped with a new generation of high-efficiency compressors, the low sound level of <45db of the ice cube making won’t affect your daily tasks. The air-cooling system helps the ice machine cool down quickly, prolonging its lifespan. Press the \"-\" button for more than 5 seconds to enter the automatic cleaning function. The process takes about 20 minutes to complete. (Please clean your ice machine regularly.) [LCD & Digital Display] The easy-to-read digital push button design makes our ice cube maker easier to operate. When there is not enough water in the water tank, the indicator will light up, reminding you to add more water. Or when the ice bucket is full, the ice maker will remind you to remove the extra ice cubes, so the ice maker can work perfectly. The visible window allows you to monitor the ice-making process at any time without opening it. [Multiple Use] This ice maker countertop can produce high-quality ice cubes that can be used for a wide range of purposes. For example, you can refresh yourself with one ice cube in the hot summer, make delicious cold drinks for your family, make a refreshing cocktail for friends at leisure, or even use the ice maker machine as an ice pack to store ice cubes for camping, etc. [Portable & Compact] This ice maker size is 12 ¼\"×16 ⅜\"×15 ¼\" which is more compact, compared with other ice makers in the market. And its' weight is only 21.38lbs. No matter if used at home or office, or even taken out for camping, this portable and compact ice maker machine is your best choice!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qbZbSQFHL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TRUSTECH","source_asin":"B0B7J1ZJPL","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-95580","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7J1ZJPL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7J1ZJPL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
