window.products.push({"id":95687,"name":"HomeProtect Egg Holder for Refrigerator 36 Count Large New Upgrade Stackable Plastic Egg Cartons, 2 Layer Thick Clear Fridge Egg Container Bins, Egg S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718E6LRVtqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Large containers]-- Each egg container can hold up to 18 eggs, 2 layers stackable design provide 36 eggs capacity.Holds 3 dozen Eggs. A great gift to friend who has farm with chickens and those who love to bake. [Auto Roll Egg Holder] -- The egg tray for refrigerator adopts a 7°slope design, is easy to take, after removing an egg at the front, the egg at the back will auto roll up. And two slope tracks are added to the egg tray. Compared to other egg cartons, the eggs roll down to the bottom for easy access, the dual-line track slides more easily and doesn't get stuck in the middle. [Easy to Clean] -- Hand wash. The egg holder is suitable for daily use, easy to clean and wipe down. Please note, do not put it in the dishwasher, it may cause the egg carton to melt [Easy to Use] -- The egg storage container for refrigerator can be stacked so that you can stack things on top of the container. Space Saver. Each layer of fridge egg holder is fixed with a card slot, easy to assemble, making it stable and reliable. The detachable design can be adjusted according to daily needs. [Clear Egg Tray] -- Egg container keeps your refrigerator neat & organized. You can see exactly how many eggs you have without having to open an egg container before every store trip! [Premium Egg Holder for Refrigerator] -- The egg containers are sized 11.8×8.2 inches and 5.3 inches in 2-layer height, made of high-quality PET material, BPA-FREE and odorless. Not easy to bent and is durable for use. The eggs fit the slots well to avoid unstable and cracking while moving. [Keep Your Egg Fresh] -- Innovation semi-enclosed design not only provide convenience for your life, but also provides good ventilation that helps keep egg fresh, and at the same time keeping the smell of eggs from affecting other food inside the fridge. [Space Saver] --The egg storage container for refrigerator is convenient to use in fridge, freezers, kitchen cabinets. Not only does it have a large capacity for storing eggs, but other things can be stacked on top of the egg carton, saving more refrigerator space. Also great for holding small fruits and vegetables. [Excellent after-sales service] -- If you are not satisfied with the product in any way, please do not hesitate to contact us. All problems will be solved within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718E6LRVtqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomeProtect","source_asin":"B0B8V333X6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-95687","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8V333X6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8V333X6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":95688,"name":"Waterspecialist LT1000PC ADQ747935 MDJ64844601 NSF Certified Refrigerator Water Filter and Air Filter, Replacement for LG® LT1000P®, LT-1000PC and LT1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jbQAnhteL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Waterspecialist refrigerator water filter features filtration performance is comparable to the original brand. It is also certified by authority NSF 42 and 372. Far different from generic brand, Waterspecialist only adopts 100% superior coconut shell carbon block to improve taste and odor. Great filtration: Waterspecialist refrigerator filters can reduce many harmful substances in water including heavy metals, mercury, chlorine, odor, THM, VOCs (volatile organic compounds), particles, copper, cadmium, chromium, and all other major impurities. This has been tested and proven by an independent third-party laboratory. The air filter keeps your food's tastes and smells separated, making the air inside your refrigerator fresh. Premium filter material: We also adopt 100% natural coconut shell carbon block that contains larger surface area and more micropores than inferior carbon block. Thus, the filter cartridge can efficiently reduce chlorine, bad taste and odor. Perfect fit: Waterspecialist combines precision measurement technology to produce 100% fit refrigerator filters with exquisite engineering designs, unlike inferior replacement filters that can cause water leakage issues. Also, Waterspecialist saves you time and hassle by offering tool-free refrigerator filter replacements. Waterspecialist selected BPA-free and food-grade filter housing that passed NSF 372 certification for lead-free filtration. Monthly install stickers: Expired replacement filters might cause an accumulation of pollutants and only achieve low-standard filtration performance. Therefore, Waterspecialist filters come with date labels that remind you to change it on time. Besides, the filter life is 6 months or 200 gallons (varies based on the water condition). Responsibility: Each product manufactured by Waterspecialist, must pass extremely high examination standards. This does not stop when a filter leaves our factory: our 24/7 customer service team will provide water purification solutions and help you answer your questions at any time. Replacement for Water Filter Models: LG LT1000P, LT1000PC, LT1000PCS, LT-1000PC, ADQ74793501, MDJ64844601; Kenmore 46-9980, 9980, ADQ74793502, PF16, GF-1000P, CF16, WD-LT1000P, AQF-LT1000P, WS646A, MB-LT1000P, BL003-S, RWF1053, CWMF002, ZWFL7-RF300, CLT-2, OH-1000p, AB-9834. Replacement for Air Filter Models: LG LT120F, ADQ73214402, ADQ73214403, ADQ73214404, ADQ73334008, 46-9918, 469918, 9918. LG is a registered trademark of LG CORP. LG is used for reference purposes only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jbQAnhteL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waterspecialist","source_asin":"B0C7ZYH35C","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-95688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7ZYH35C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7ZYH35C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
