window.products.push({"id":95737,"name":"Reusable Premium Metal Filters by Slimm Filter for Use in the AeroPress Coffee Maker, Package of 2 Filters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S-O-Gl+tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Made for Aeropress, Made for Excellent Coffee When we first used the Aeropress we ran into the same problem as you – paper filters. While we saw the potential of the Aeropress, common paper filters were not only wasteful, but also undermined the coffee taste. Good thing that we came up with our own, reusable aeropress filter. So, why do we think this Aeropress coffee maker and our Aeropress metal filter make an excellent combination? It's simple: tastes great and lasts for years. Our 2-Piece set includes a 2x Mesh Aeropress permanent filters that allow you to minimize waste, and achieve impeccable coffee. Product Specifications:; Dimensions of each filter: 2.4” Inches Materials: Stainless Steel Package Inclusions: 2 x Mesh Coffee Filter Less Mess, More Flavor No more wasteful paper filters or coffee that never really hits the spot. If you invest in a good roast, our Aeropress accessories help you fine tune your coffee to taste, without absorbing essential oils that make up the body of your variety’s flavor.  Our mesh Aeropress coffee filters let you control the grit, the acidity, and the fullness of your end result – much like your trusted barista would. Plus, with every set you get our “How to Make the Perfect Cup of Coffee Every Time” so that you enjoy your Aeropress just like you should – with no compromise.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S-O-Gl+tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Slimm Filter","source_asin":"B00SAEX73U","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-95737","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00SAEX73U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00SAEX73U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
