window.products.push({"id":95832,"name":"Frigidaire EFIC108-BLUE Counter-top Portable, Compact Ice Maker, Blue, 26 lb per Day & OXO Good Grips Flexible Scoop","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":104.35,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51S7-X3UbGL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Frigidaire Portable Compact Maker, Counter Top Ice Making Machine, 26lb per day (Blue) (EFIC108-BLUE)This Igloo compact ice maker will blow you away. The beautiful Blue finish will add style to any kitchen. It produces up to 26 pounds of ice per day and will make a batch of ice in as little as 6 minutes. This Igloo ice maker stores up to 1.5 pounds of ice at a time and has a 2.3 Quart reservoir with electronic controls with LED indicators. This counter-top ice machine features the compressor cooling system and operates at low noise. The modern design and adjustable cube size add to the unique functionality of this Counter-top Ice Maker. For set up and trouble shooting steps refer to the user manual. HIGHLIGHTS Convenient, compact design is ideal for use in small kitchens & other compact spaces like RVs, boats & more This Igloo Portable ice maker requires no installation - just plug in unit, add water & wait up to 6 minutes to enjoy fresh ice PRODUCT FEATURES Compact Ice Maker in Blue Enjoy a batch of ice in as little as 6 minutes Produces 26lbs of ice per day in choice of 2 ice sizes Stores up to 1.5 lbs of ice at a time 2.3 Quart Reservoir with Electronic LED Controls SPECIFICATIONS Product Depth (in.): 15 inches Product Height (in.): 14.5 inches Product Width (in.): 11.25 inchesOXO Good Grips Flexible ScoopOXO's handy Scoop is a versatile addition to your kitchen, perfect for scooping ice, flour, cereal and more. The compact head fits easily into all sorts of canisters and bins and is flexible for easy funneling into smaller containers. Try leaving this Scoop in your freezer's ice maker; the Scoop stays comfortable to the touch and ice cubes won't stick to it. A soft handle provides a comfortable, firm grip. The Scoop holds approximately 1 cup.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51S7-X3UbGL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FRIGIDAIRE","source_asin":"B08MZR8J8G","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-95832","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MZR8J8G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MZR8J8G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
