window.products.push({"id":95978,"name":"Clear Choice Lead Reduction Replacement Water Filter Compatible for DA29-00020B CLCH105L - Certified to the NSF/ANSI 42 & 53 Standard for Chlorine & L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21iDu8V+qZL._AC_.jpg","description":"The aftermarket ClearChoice CLCH105 filter is cost effective alternative to factory original is used in French Door and Side-by-Side refrigerators by Samsung. It is designed to replace the factory part # DA29-00019A, DA29-00020B and HAF-CIN. The CLCH105 filter uses advanced filtration media which captures and reduces chlorine, lead and other contaminants in your water. This filter has been System Tested and Certified by Envirotek Laboratories, Inc. against NSF/ANSI Standard 53 for reduction of Lead and Chloroform and against NSF/ANSI Standard 42 for Chloramine, Chlorine, Taste, and Odor. :Certified to the NSF/ANSI 42 & 53 Standard for chlorine & lead reduction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21iDu8V+qZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Clear Choice","source_asin":"B07T28VTXY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-95978","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T28VTXY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T28VTXY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":95979,"name":"Stove Gap Cover, 23.6 inch Stove Guard, Stainless Steel Stove Filler, Easy to Clean, Heat Resistant Oven Gap Filler Seals Gaps Between Stovetop and Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51N+6e-C5gL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The size of the stove gap covers is 23.6(L)*0.8(W). It suits for the gap less than 0.8 inches while the length of stove more than 23.6 inches. High quality. Our stove gap covers are made of high quality 304 stainless steel. Unlike the silicone stove gap covers which is easy to melt or even burn when heated, our stainless steel ones are very heat-resistant. Safe to use. The edges of our stove gap covers are all polished by hand, so there will be no burrs and sharpness. Easy to install. There are two spring pieces on the stainless steel stove gap covers. Insert the stove gap cover to fit the gap perfectly after bending. Easy to clean. Take the stove gap cover out of the gap, rinse it with water, and wipe it lightly to make it as clean as new.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51N+6e-C5gL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"wavkraft","source_asin":"B0BR5ZR4V8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-95979","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR5ZR4V8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR5ZR4V8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":95980,"name":"Nugget Ice Maker, Qualeben Countertop Ice Maker Machine 26lb/Day, Self-Cleaning, Auto Water Refill Crunchy Chewable Ice Maker with 4.8lb Ice Bin & Sco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61h7Afd6MrL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Crunchy, Airy, Chewable Nugget Ice: Enjoy the best nugget ice for your favorite drinks. Whether you love a glass of soft drink, or like to mix your own cocktail, the crunchy, airy, chewable nugget ice from Qualeben ice maker will always take them to the next level. It makes your beverage ice-cold fast, keeps it cold longer, and allows you to munch the flavored ice after you finish your drink. Get More Ice Faster: When you want an icy beverage fast, we have you covered! Qualeben nugget ice maker produces ice in just 16 minutes, well before you finish preparing your cocktail. And the machine produces up to 26 lb of ice on a single day. The ice maker not just generates ice fast, but also holds 4.8 lbs of ice, plenty enough for an entire day, or the whole party by the pool, and more. A Smart Ice Maker: Auto water refill and production for endless ice supply. Simply connect tap water to the ice maker, which will automatically refill water when the reservoir is empty. And the ice maker detects whether the ice bin is full, stops when it's, and automatically continues when the ice is running low, always keeping a full bin of ice at the ready. Keep it Clean Easier: No more scrubbing thanks to the self-cleaning function. Easily clean the ice maker by pressing the \"CLEAN\" button for a thorough, 8-minute self-cleaning cycle of flushing fresh water through the system. The detachable filter and internal cleaning system will ensure maximum cleanliness and health. Customer Orientation: Qualeben will consider everything for customers. The quiet operation is less than 50dB, which will never disturb you. We also provide an ice scoop, 10ft hose, and an additional drain plug. We want you to feel safe with your purchase, that's why we provide our customers with a 2-year warranty. The ETL certified and FDA compliance material makes it safe enough.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61h7Afd6MrL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qualeben","source_asin":"B0BG78CFN6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-95980","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG78CFN6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG78CFN6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
